{"id":"sabido","lemma":"sabido","pos":"adj","rank":1237,"glosses":["well-known"],"ipa":"/saˈbido/","forms":{"feminine":"sabida","masculinePlural":"sabidos","femininePlural":"sabidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-sabido.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Has sabido algo de él?","en":"Have you heard from him?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70192","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"something, anything"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"he"}]},{"text":"Si lo hubiera sabido, te lo habría dicho.","en":"If I'd known it, I'd have told you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693470","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"saying, expression"}]},{"text":"Tom debería haberlo sabido.","en":"Tom should've known.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/107031","words":[null,{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null]},{"text":"Ojalá hubiera sabido la verdad.","en":"I wish I had known the truth.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333143","words":[{"g":"I wish"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"honestly, to be honest"]]},{"text":"Tienen que haberlo sabido desde el principio.","en":"They must've known it all along.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/422634","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},null,{"g":"since"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"principle"}]}]}